{"root":{"data":{"id":"dlhhqmkltug0","created":1789638041926,"text":"研发部当前问题分析"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlhhqt6v9140","created":1789638056332,"text":"项目超期"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlhhrd2984o0","created":1789638099589,"text":"项目节点不合理"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlhhso8mm340","created":1789638202283,"text":"项目多、杂、急，经常有紧急任务插入，导致时间被压缩，工作缺乏连贯性，导致效率降低"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlhht1qyqk00","created":1789638231690,"text":"定制或与客户承诺节点时，没能从分考虑当前任务和团队规模"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dlhhrv6fhls0","created":1789638139024,"text":"人工不足"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlhhs9jied40","created":1789638170289,"text":"人员数量"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dlhhseoyhv40","created":1789638181503,"text":"个人工作时长"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dlhhuxmuemg0","created":1789638379462,"text":"分支主题"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}